WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.801
Calcifer, you're so obedient.

00:00:10.218 --> 00:00:11.803
She bullied me.

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:15.181
Not an easy thing to do.

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:17.058
Who exactly are you?

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:20.228
I'm Grandma Sophie.

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:23.064
You see, I'm your new cleaning lady.

00:00:23.606 --> 00:00:24.733
Give me that.

00:00:28.737 --> 00:00:31.865
Pass me two more bacon slices
and six more eggs.

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:53.470
Yummy.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.764
Yummy.

00:01:02.771 --> 00:01:04.773
And who hired you to clean?

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:07.233
Why, I hired myself.

00:01:07.317 --> 00:01:09.736
I've never seen such a filthy house.

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:13.573
Markl, plates.

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:19.579
You're all ganging up on me.

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:21.414
Please join us, Sophie.

00:01:26.878 --> 00:01:28.588
Sit over here.

